        <a class="btn hide-mobile" href="#contact"><span data-en>Hire Me</span><span data-id>Rekrut Saya</span></a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="home" class="hero" style="border-top:none;">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">MUHAMMAD ASLAMBIK</div>
      <h1 class="headline">
        <span data-en>AI Automation <span class="accent">Made Simple.</span></span>
        <span data-id>Otomasi AI <span class="accent">Dibuat Sederhana.</span></span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-desc">
        <span data-en>AI Automation Engineer — designing n8n workflows that connect forms, documents, AI agents, and notifications into one process that runs on its own.</span>
        <span data-id>AI Automation Engineer — merancang workflow n8n yang menghubungkan form, dokumen, AI agent, dan notifikasi jadi satu alur kerja yang jalan sendiri.</span>
      </p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href="#project" class="btn-solid"><span data-en>See how it works ↓</span><span data-id>Lihat cara kerjanya ↓</span></a>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn-outline"><span data-en>Get in touch</span><span data-id>Hubungi saya</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual">
      <div class="avatar-ring"><div class="inner">MA</div></div>
      <div class="name">Muhammad Aslambik</div>
      <div class="role">AI Automation Engineer</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-label"><span data-en>// about</span><span data-id>// tentang</span></div>
    <h2 class="section-title"><span data-en>From writing stories, to writing workflows.</span><span data-id>Dari menulis cerita, ke menulis alur kerja.</span></h2>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-text">
        <p data-en class="block">I work at the intersection of <strong>automation</strong> and <strong>AI</strong> — designing n8n workflows that replace repetitive manual processes: from incoming forms, to document processing, to AI-assisted decisions, without anyone having to handle each step by hand.</p>
        <p data-id class="block">Saya bekerja di titik temu antara <strong>otomasi</strong> dan <strong>AI</strong> — merancang workflow n8n yang menggantikan proses manual berulang: dari form masuk, dokumen diproses, sampai keputusan dibantu AI Agent, tanpa seseorang harus duduk mengerjakannya satu per satu.</p>

        <p data-en class="block">My flagship project is an <strong>automated CV screening system</strong> — from an applicant filling out a form, to their CV being extracted and read, scored by an AI Agent against role criteria, to a result email sent automatically to shortlisted and non-shortlisted candidates alike.</p>
        <p data-id class="block">Project andalan saya adalah <strong>sistem screening CV otomatis</strong> — mulai dari pelamar mengisi form, CV-nya diambil dan dibaca, dinilai oleh AI berdasarkan kriteria posisi, sampai email hasil terkirim otomatis ke kandidat lolos maupun tidak.</p>

        <p data-en class="block">Beyond automation, I'm also comfortable on the <strong>visual and content side</strong> — design in Canva and website management in WordPress — so a project can be handled end-to-end, from the system to what people actually see.</p>
        <p data-id class="block">Selain automation, saya juga terbiasa mengerjakan sisi <strong>visual dan konten</strong> — desain di Canva dan pengelolaan website di WordPress — jadi satu project bisa saya kerjakan dari sistemnya sampai tampilannya.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="info-row"><span class="info-label"><span data-en>Base</span><span data-id>Basis</span></span><span class="info-val"><span data-en>Indonesia (remote)</span><span data-id>Indonesia (remote)</span></span></div>
        <div class="info-row"><span class="info-label"><span data-en>Focus</span><span data-id>Fokus</span></span><span class="info-val">Workflow Automation & AI Agent</span></div>
        <div class="info-row"><span class="info-label"><span data-en>Main Tool</span><span data-id>Tool Utama</span></span><span class="info-val">n8n</span></div>
        <div class="info-row"><span class="info-label">Status</span><span class="info-val status"><span data-en>Open for new projects</span><span data-id>Terbuka untuk project</span></span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="skill">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-label"><span data-en>// skills</span><span data-id>// kemampuan</span></div>
    <h2 class="section-title"><span data-en>Two sides of the work that complement each other.</span><span data-id>Dua sisi kerja yang saling melengkapi.</span></h2>
    <p class="section-sub"><span data-en>Able to build the system itself, and the interface people actually see.</span><span data-id>Bisa membangun sistemnya sekaligus menyiapkan tampilan yang dilihat orang.</span></p>
    <div class="skills-grid">
      <div class="skill-card">
        <h3>Automation & AI</h3>
        <p><span data-en>Designing and running end-to-end automated systems.</span><span data-id>Merancang dan menjalankan sistem otomatis end-to-end.</span></p>
        <div class="tag-list">
          <span class="tag">n8n</span><span class="tag">AI Agent / LLM</span><span class="tag">Google Sheets API</span>
          <span class="tag">Google Drive API</span><span class="tag">Gmail API</span><span class="tag">Structured Output</span><span class="tag">Error Handling</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="skill-card">
        <h3>Design & Content</h3>
        <p><span data-en>Handling the side people directly see and use.</span><span data-id>Menyiapkan sisi yang dilihat dan digunakan langsung oleh orang.</span></p>
        <div class="tag-list">
          <span class="tag">Canva</span><span class="tag">WordPress</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="project">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-label">// project</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">CV Screening Automation</h2>
    <p class="section-sub"><span data-en>A complete workflow from CV submission to candidate response — no manual steps in between.</span><span data-id>Alur kerja penuh dari CV masuk sampai kandidat dapat kabar — tanpa campur tangan manual.</span></p>

    <div class="workflow-box">
      <div class="workflow-header">
        <span class="workflow-title">cv-screening-automation.n8n</span>
        <span class="status-pill"><span class="status-dot"></span>4 nodes · 1 branch · <span data-en>running</span><span data-id>berjalan</span></span>
      </div>
      <div class="workflow-diagram">
        <div class="node"><div class="n-title">Form</div><div class="n-sub"><span data-en>submission</span><span data-id>masuk</span></div></div>
        <div class="arrow"></div>
        <div class="node"><div class="n-title"><span data-en>Extract CV</span><span data-id>Ekstrak CV</span></div><div class="n-sub">drive → parse pdf</div></div>
        <div class="arrow"></div>
        <div class="node"><div class="n-title">AI Agent</div><div class="n-sub"><span data-en>scoring + JSON output</span><span data-id>scoring + output JSON</span></div></div>
        <div class="arrow"></div>
        <div class="branch">
          <div class="node pass"><div class="n-title"><span data-en>Passed</span><span data-id>Lolos</span></div><div class="n-sub">email + sheet</div></div>
          <div class="node reject"><div class="n-title"><span data-en>Rejected</span><span data-id>Tidak lolos</span></div><div class="n-sub">email + sheet</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 style="font-family:var(--sans); font-size:20px; margin-bottom:14px;">
      <span data-en>A recruiting system that scores CVs and replies on its own</span>
      <span data-id>Sistem rekrutmen yang menilai CV dan membalasnya sendiri</span>
    </h3>
    <p style="color:var(--text-dim); font-size:15px; max-width:760px; margin-bottom:40px;">
      <span data-en>A candidate fills out an application form, their CV is automatically read and scored by an AI Agent against role criteria (skills, education, experience), then the system sends a different email to shortlisted and non-shortlisted candidates — with results logged automatically to Google Sheets, and error alerts if any step fails.</span>
      <span data-id>Kandidat mengisi form lamaran, CV-nya otomatis dibaca dan dinilai oleh AI Agent berdasarkan kriteria posisi (skill, pendidikan, pengalaman), lalu sistem mengirim email berbeda ke kandidat yang lolos maupun tidak — lengkap dengan pencatatan otomatis ke Google Sheets dan notifikasi error kalau ada langkah yang gagal.</span>
    </p>

    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">01</div>
        <h4>Form Submission</h4>
        <p><span data-en>The applicant submits their details and CV through a form.</span><span data-id>Pelamar mengisi data diri dan mengunggah CV lewat form.</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">02</div>
        <h4><span data-en>Extract CV</span><span data-id>Ekstrak CV</span></h4>
        <p><span data-en>File is uploaded to Drive, re-downloaded, and its content extracted to text.</span><span data-id>File diunggah ke Drive, diunduh ulang, isinya diekstrak jadi teks.</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">03</div>
        <h4>CV Scoring</h4>
        <p><span data-en>AI Agent reads the role criteria and scores CV fit in a structured format.</span><span data-id>AI Agent membaca kriteria posisi dan menilai kecocokan CV dalam format terstruktur.</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">04</div>
        <h4>Send Feedback</h4>
        <p><span data-en>Results are logged to a sheet and an email is sent automatically based on status.</span><span data-id>Hasil dicatat ke sheet dan email otomatis terkirim sesuai status kelulusan.</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="project-cta">
      <a href="https://github.com/muhammadaslambik" class="btn-outline"><span data-en>View on GitHub →</span><span data-id>Lihat GitHub →</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
  <div class="wrap">
